///| HTTP/HTTPS (curl-impersonate), cookie jar, pure-Pion WHATWG encoding, image conversion, and WebSocket bindings.
///| 1:1 port of `src/fetch/fetch.mbt` and `src/fetch/ws.mbt` linking `fetch.c` + `ws.c` + `libcurl-impersonate.a`.

